# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party datasets — NEVER committed. We hold access rights to the Kaggle
# competition data; we hold no right to redistribute it. This repo may go
# public, so the rules below are deliberately broad and extension-based rather
# than path-anchored: a dataset dropped in a new directory must be ignored by
# default, not by remembering to add a path. Tracking a data file requires an
# explicit `!` exception here and a deliberate answer to "may we publish this?".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.arrow
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.npy
*.npz
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.xlsx
*.zip
*.csv.gz
*.tsv.gz
*.json.gz
*.jsonl
*.ndjson

# The experiment tree is operator-local and out of this repo entirely.
#
#   experiments/  the sweep machinery + spec catalog + the runnable experimental design. It drives
#                 runs, it is not part of the harness, and the experimental record it produces is
#                 versioned in the sibling `verity-analysis` repo. Keep a copy there or on disk.
#   results/      raw sweep output (RunReports, transcripts, submissions, the durable store) plus
#                 the prototyping task package. Finished batches are imported into verity-analysis
#                 with scripts/import_results.sh; what is left here is scratch.
#   figures/      analysis output, authored and versioned in verity-analysis.
#
# tests/test_ablation_*.py `importorskip` the experiments package, so a checkout without it stays
# green.
/experiments/
/results/
/figures/
figures/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Claude Code per-user permissions
.claude/settings.local.json
